{"synopsis":"The leaves of the chess game beside Lanke, and the chess game between the old trees is uninteresting, causing Tian Yuan's son, and then looking back at the vast mountains and seas... When he wakes up, Ji Yuan has become a half-blind beggar in a dilapidated mountain temple. A real person has a sword and a magic stick has a mouth, which is the foundation of Jiyuan's foothold in this terrible world.\n\n---\n\nWilted leaves beside the board, empty seats between the towering trees, a passerby who chose to put down a stone in the middle of the board, unbeknownst to him eons have passed… Waking up from his slumber, Ji Yuan found himself as a half-blind beggar. Armed with only a sword and his wits, he will venture forth into this danger-filled world.","alternative_title":"Lan Ke Qi Yuan, 烂柯棋缘, ChronoGo, Special Destiny Of Rotten Ke, Lạn Kha Kỳ Duyên, The Board Of Lanke","author":"Yuewen Manhua (阅文漫画)","artist":"Yuewen Manhua (阅文漫画)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"45a69a21-79f9-492b-9802-f1af83836eb6","number":"302","chapter":"302","title":"","date":"2025-11-24","released":"2025-11-24"},{"chapter_id":"f86e47d5-7138-48ae-866e-01d77180db04","number":"301","chapter":"301","title":"","date":"2025-11-24","released":"2025-11-24"},{"chapter_id":"b3b8f138-a223-42a3-b185-20da26681064","number":"300","chapter":"300","title":"","date":"2025-11-24","released":"2025-11-24"},{"chapter_id":"dbc57744-9fa7-47d1-ac25-89a572fcbe86","number":"299","chapter":"299","title":"","date":"2025-11-24","released":"2025-11-24"},{"chapter_id":"f111cb36-60bf-4ed8-85b2-dbf8744b9ac3","number":"298","chapter":"298","title":"","date":"2025-11-24","released":"2025-11-24"},{"chapter_id":"b3a054d0-3824-4a18-9236-c4679d849633","number":"297","chapter":"297","title":"","date":"2025-11-24","released":"2025-11-24"},{"chapter_id":"6ad0da2a-510d-4903-81b4-a41a20a240e5","number":"296","chapter":"296","title":"","date":"2025-11-24","released":"2025-11-24"},{"chapter_id":"f844bc21-0a41-4ccb-8ad5-9af66c0e1380","nu